---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/') ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;
---
<Layout title="The Banshee" active="Hangar">
  <section class="detail-hero"><div class="page-wrap detail-grid"><div class="detail-copy"><p class="kicker">Hangar file 02 // not ours</p><h1>The<br />Banshee</h1><p class="lede">Sirona O’Keefe’s ship, and the reason we survived Sel Zonn Station. Technically a borrowed vessel. Practically our mobile base of operations.</p><div class="stamp">THE BANSHEE<br />STATUS: ACTIVE / O’KEEFE PROPERTY<br />ROLE: MOBILE BASE<br />PILOTING NOTE: DAX REMAINS NORMAL ABOUT THIS</div></div><img class="detail-image" src={`${base}media/ship_galley.jpg`} alt="The Banshee interior galley" /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="page-wrap detail-grid"><div><p class="kicker">Operational notes</p><h2>Not our ship.<br />Our problem.</h2><p class="lede" style="margin-top:24px">The Banshee is where plans get made, supplies get hidden, wounds get dressed, and Dax attempts to appear casual around Sirona O’Keefe. It is the dependable one in the fleet, which is why we keep putting it in danger.</p><div class="spec-table"><div class="spec-row"><span>Owner</span><strong>Sirona O’Keefe</strong></div><div class="spec-row"><span>Role</span><strong>Rescue craft / mobile base / occasional escape route</strong></div><div class="spec-row"><span>Home</span><strong>Wherever the next job is</strong></div><div class="spec-row"><span>Reputation</span><strong>Better than ours</strong></div></div></div><div class="plate about-card"><p class="kicker">Bridge gossip</p><h3>“She’s cool.”</h3><p style="margin-top:20px">Dax has said this about Sirona approximately every time her name appears in a transmission. The Banshee remains a sound vessel under competent ownership. We are trying not to ruin that.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
